                                                "sense_id": "cbef0589-523a-3c20-beca-23ae6444e50f",
                                                "text": "[Valium] was followed by many imitators, all sharing the same pharmacological mechanism, which is to enhance the actions of the key inhibitory brain chemical messenger GABA."
                                            },
