                                                "example_id": "f111b6e8-08ba-4d1a-9ecf-0765babbf412",
                                                "sense_id": "cbef0589-523a-3c20-beca-23ae6444e50f",
                                                "text": "Its action as an inhibitor also distinguishes GABA from the “big three” amines—dopamine, norepinephrine, and serotonin—which generally stimulate brain circuits."
